From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "D.R.racer" <drracer@seznam.cz>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:28:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] iio: adc: sun4i-gpadc: wait for a mode change only when
 the mode changes

sun4i_prepare_for_irq() waits 100 ms when the IP switches between the
ADC and the touchscreen mode, but it compares the previous mode with
the ADC mode, whatever mode is being set. A temperature read sets the
touchscreen mode, so the next temperature read finds "not ADC mode"
again and waits too: every temperature read takes 100 ms. With the
thermal zone polled every second (A10), this busy wait keeps the CPU
10% busy and the cpufreq governor at the highest operating point.

Compare the previous mode with the one being set.

Fixes: d1caa9905538 ("iio: adc: add support for Allwinner SoCs ADC")
Tested on a Rikomagic MK802 (A10, 1 GiB).

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/iio/adc/sun4i-gpadc-iio.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/iio/adc/sun4i-gpadc-iio.c b/drivers/iio/adc/sun4i-gpadc-iio.c
index c1ea91ece..d51f50423 100644
--- a/drivers/iio/adc/sun4i-gpadc-iio.c
+++ b/drivers/iio/adc/sun4i-gpadc-iio.c
@@ -161,7 +161,7 @@ static int sun4i_prepare_for_irq(struct iio_dev *indio_dev, int channel,
 {
 	struct sun4i_gpadc_iio *info = iio_priv(indio_dev);
 	int ret;
-	u32 reg;
+	u32 reg, adc_select;
 
 	pm_runtime_get_sync(indio_dev->dev.parent);
 
@@ -178,6 +178,7 @@ static int sun4i_prepare_for_irq(struct iio_dev *indio_dev, int channel,
 		return ret;
 
 	if (irq == info->fifo_data_irq) {
+		adc_select = info->data->tp_adc_select;
 		ret = regmap_write(info->regmap, SUN4I_GPADC_CTRL1,
 				   info->data->tp_mode_en |
 				   info->data->tp_adc_select |
@@ -195,6 +196,7 @@ static int sun4i_prepare_for_irq(struct iio_dev *indio_dev, int channel,
 		 * The temperature sensor returns valid data only when the ADC
 		 * operates in touchscreen mode.
 		 */
+		adc_select = 0;
 		ret = regmap_write(info->regmap, SUN4I_GPADC_CTRL1,
 				   info->data->tp_mode_en);
 	}
@@ -206,7 +208,7 @@ static int sun4i_prepare_for_irq(struct iio_dev *indio_dev, int channel,
 	 * When the IP changes mode between ADC or touchscreen, it
 	 * needs a bit of time to get correct values.
 	 */
-	if ((reg & info->data->tp_adc_select) != info->data->tp_adc_select)
+	if ((reg & info->data->tp_adc_select) != adc_select)
 		mdelay(100);
 
 	return 0;
-- 
